      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UBEEN THUNDASTRUCK (2) recorded a strong performance last start when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 2130m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. KEEGAN BANNER NZ (6) last raced three weeks ago when he scored a game win over 2503m at this track, getting home by a neck after leading as the odds-on favourite at the bell. Meets a similar line up so he can certainly win again. PRIDDAH (7) is on the radar after his last-start sixth over 2130m at this track a week-and-a-half ago after he raced three-back on the fence at the bell. Racing in an easier line-up here has palace prospects. MAD PUNTA (3) won here three runs back but disappointed last time out. Is an each-way chance based on a good third over 2185m at Pinjarra two runs back.",
